"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[4,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#tips\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Expert Tips & Best Practices\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[5,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#mistakes\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Common Mistakes to Avoid\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[6,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#faq\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🐾 Introduction\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Proven techniques to teach pets their names. Step-by-step guide. Whether you're naming a new pet, a character in your story, or just exploring for fun, you've come to the right place. At Animal Name Generator, we've curated thousands of name ideas across hundreds of animal species to help you find that perfect match.\"]}],\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\"]}],\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$L3d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$3e\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@3f\"}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Our database spans \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"19\",{\"href\":\"/animal/nurse-shark/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Nurse Shark\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"34\",{\"href\":\"/animal/aardvark/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Aardvark\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"46\",{\"href\":\"/animal/echidna/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Echidna\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"57\",{\"href\":\"/animal/luna-moth/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Luna Moth\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"70\",{\"href\":\"/animal/llama/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Llama\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"79\",{\"href\":\"/animal/numbat/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Numbat\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and many more — each with 160+ hand-picked names. This guide focuses on bringing you the best of the best in one convenient place.\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"💡 Why the Right Name Matters\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"A name is the first gift you give your pet. It's the word you'll say thousands of times over their lifetime — at mealtime, during play, at the vet, and in quiet moments of connection. The right name strengthens your bond and makes training easier. A well-chosen name reflects your pet's personality, your interests, and the special relationship you share.\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Research shows that pets respond best to names with 1-2 syllables and distinct consonant sounds. Names ending in a vowel or \\\"ee\\\" sound are particularly effective. But beyond the science, a name should feel right to you — because you'll be using it every single day.\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"📝 Step-by-Step Naming Guide\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"Step 1: Observe Your Pet\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Before deciding, spend 2-3 days observing your pet's personality. Is your \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"74\",{\"href\":\"/animal/nurse-shark/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Nurse Shark\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" energetic or calm? Playful or dignified? Curious or reserved? Their unique traits will guide you toward the perfect name.\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"Step 2: Make a Shortlist\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Write down 10-15 names that appeal to you. Say them out loud. Imagine calling them across a park. Eliminate names that are hard to pronounce, too similar to commands, or that you'd feel awkward saying in public.\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"Step 3: Test Your Top 3\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Try your top 3 names for a day each. Use treats and positive reinforcement when saying the name. See which one feels most natural and gets the best response from your pet.\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"Step 4: Get a Second Opinion\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Ask family members or friends. A name that sounds clever to you might be confusing or inappropriate to others. Your pet's name should bring joy to everyone who uses it.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n20:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n22:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🐕 Training Techniques That Work\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"p\",\"29\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"The most effective name training uses positive reinforcement. Start in a quiet room with no distractions. Say your pet's name in a bright, happy voice. The moment they look at you — even for a split second — mark the behavior with a clicker or a word like 'yes!' and immediately give a high-value treat. Repeat this 10-15 times in short sessions of 2-3 minutes each.\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Once your pet reliably responds to their name in a quiet room (usually 3-5 sessions), gradually add distractions. Move to a room with family members, then to the backyard, then to a quiet park. Each new environment may temporarily reduce responsiveness — that's normal. Be patient and return to basics when needed.\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"31\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"The 'Name Game' Exercise\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"p\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"This fun exercise speeds up name recognition: Have two people sit 10 feet apart. Person A calls the pet's name cheerfully. When the pet comes, they get a treat and praise. Then Person B calls. The pet runs back and forth, learning their name through play. Most pets love this game and learn their name within 1-2 sessions.\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"33\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"Species-Specific Tips\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Dogs are the fastest name learners — most dogs recognize their name within 1-2 weeks of consistent training. Cats learn at their own pace; some respond within days while others take weeks. Use extra-special treats like tuna or chicken for feline training sessions. Birds, especially parrots, are excellent name learners and may even learn to say their own name. Rabbits and guinea pigs can learn to recognize their names with patience, responding best to high-pitched, gentle calling.\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"35\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"📚 Advanced Training: Name + Commands\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Once your pet knows their name, you can layer it with commands: 'Max, come!' or 'Luna, sit!' The name serves as an attention-getter, signaling to your pet that the next words are meant for them. Practice name + single command combinations before moving to more complex sequences. Remember: your pet's name should always signal something positive is about to happen — never use it right before something they dislike.\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"For multi-pet households, name training is essential. Each pet needs to know when you're talking to THEM versus another animal. Train each pet individually first, then practice with all pets present. Reward the pet whose name you called when they respond, and gently redirect others. With consistency, your pets will learn to 'tune in' only when their name is called.\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"39\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/bouvier/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Bouvier\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"98\",{\"href\":\"/animal/vervet-monkey/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Vervet Monkey\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"121\",{\"href\":\"/animal/wolverine/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Wolverine\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"140\",{\"href\":\"/animal/ojos-azules/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Ojos Azules\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"165\",{\"href\":\"/animal/landseer/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Landseer\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🐱 Special Considerations for Rescue Pets\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Rescue pets often come with a name already — or none at all. If your rescue pet already responds to a name, consider keeping something similar to ease the transition. You can gradually shift to a new name by using both together (e.g., 'Buddy-Max' → 'Max' over 2-3 weeks). Rescue animals may have negative associations with their old name if it was used during stressful situations, so a fresh start with a new name can be a gift.\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Some rescue pets arrive with no known name history. In these cases, you have a blank slate. Observe your pet for the first week to understand their personality before committing to a name. The right name will naturally emerge as you get to know them. Remember that rescue pets often take longer to trust and respond — patience and consistency are even more important than with pets raised from young.\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔔 Name Recall in Emergency Situations\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"A well-trained name response can be lifesaving. Practice emergency recall by calling your pet's name in different tones and volumes, including a firm, urgent tone. Reward generously when they come. Practice this in safe, enclosed areas first, then in progressively more distracting environments. The goal is for your pet to respond to their name instantly, even when excited or distracted — this skill can prevent accidents and escapes.\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"For outdoor cats and dogs that spend time in yards, name recall training is essential. Even indoor pets benefit — knowing your cat will come when called can prevent panic if they accidentally slip outside. Dedicate 5 minutes daily to name recall practice and you'll build a reliable response within weeks.\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🌟 Final Thoughts & Next Steps\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Choosing or teaching your pet's name is a journey, not a race. The hours you invest now in finding the right name and building positive name associations will pay off for years to come. Every time you call your pet and they respond with enthusiasm, you'll know the effort was worth it. A name is more than a label — it's the foundation of your communication, the start of every adventure, and a daily reminder of the unique bond between you and your animal companion.\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Ready to explore more? Browse our complete collection of animal name generators at bestanimalnames.com. With 989 animal species and 160+ names per animal, you'll find inspiration for every pet, character, and creative project. Our guides, facts, and blog posts are designed to help you make the best choice — because every great relationship starts with a great name.\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I choose between multiple name options?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Try each name for a full day. Say it often, use it during play, and see which one feels most natural. The name that makes you smile every time is the winner. Trust your instincts!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can my pet have a middle name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! Many pet owners give middle names — especially useful for when your pet is being mischievous. 'Luna Bean Smith, stop that!' has a certain ring to it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should pet names match pet insurance registration?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Use the same name consistently across vet records, microchips, and insurance. In an emergency, a consistent name helps veterinary staff quickly identify and treat your pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if I change my pet's name after adoption?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Adult pets can learn new names with patience. Use lots of treats and positive reinforcement. Most pets adjust within a few weeks. Consistency is key.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"golden-lion-tamarin\",{\"href\":\"/animal/golden-lion-tamarin/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐒\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Golden Lion Tamarin\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"impala\",{\"href\":\"/animal/impala/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦌\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Impala\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"killer-whale\",{\"href\":\"/animal/killer-whale/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐋\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Killer Whale\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"cocker-spaniel\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cocker-spaniel/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐕\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Cocker Spaniel\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"caribou\",{\"href\":\"/animal/caribou/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦌\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Caribou\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"carp\",{\"href\":\"/animal/carp/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐟\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Carp\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"common-kingfisher\",{\"href\":\"/animal/common-kingfisher/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐦\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Common Kingfisher\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"long-eared-bat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/long-eared-bat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦇\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Long-Eared Bat\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"📖 Related Naming Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"persian-animal-names\",{\"href\":\"/guide/persian-animal-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Persian Animal Names — 100+ Beautiful Ideas 🐱\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"classic-parrot-names\",{\"href\":\"/guide/classic-parrot-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Classic Parrot Names — Top Classic Picks 🦜\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"norse-animal-names\",{\"href\":\"/guide/norse-animal-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl\",\"children\":\"📖\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Norse Animal Names — 100+ Beautiful Ideas ⚔️\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"📝 Related Articl